00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:30.010
we all get caught up in it.

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:30.510
Right?

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:33.550
A yak shaving is, you
start out to do something

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:35.894
big and important, and
then a day later you've

00:01:35.894 --> 00:01:37.810
done everything else but
