00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:50.650
they would go out to
harvest the year's harvest,

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:53.625
and they'd use the yaks to
pull the carts in and out.

00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:55.750
But they would find that
the yak grew all this hair

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:57.490
in the middle of the
winter, and so they

00:01:57.490 --> 00:01:59.110
couldn't fit through the gates.

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:01.180
So they'd have to turn
around and go back and do

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.430
a bunch of yak shaving to
get the yak skinny enough

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:04.390
to go through the gate.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:05.230
Right?

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:08.889
And I've heard it
said in IT, in tech,

00:02:08.889 --> 00:02:10.810
this is essentially
