00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.045
And it's a big bunch of hassle.

00:02:44.045 --> 00:02:45.670
You say, I'm going
to go have children.

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:48.820
You have these amazing ideas
of graduations and weddings,

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:50.770
