00:39:38.010 --> 00:39:40.290
You know, so what are some
of the lessons learned

00:39:40.290 --> 00:39:43.520
during those three months
[INAUDIBLE] process?

00:39:43.520 --> 00:39:48.830
The PDKs and tools, these
are all terabytes of data.

00:39:48.830 --> 00:39:50.360
So we cannot be remote NFS.

00:39:50.360 --> 00:39:55.370
So we have a local storage
in the Google Cloud.

00:39:55.370 --> 00:40:02.010
The other one is that on-prem
we are able to get results.

00:40:02.010 --> 00:40:05.300
That is where some of the
customization is needed.

00:40:05.300 --> 00:40:07.130
Terabytes of data cannot
be back and forth,

00:40:07.130 --> 00:40:10.640
even if you have a 10-gig or
100-gig line in case it won't.

00:40:10.640 --> 00:40:14.700
So we modified our flow to
only a small subset of the data

00:40:14.700 --> 00:40:17.620
to sync back to
the private cloud.

00:40:17.620 --> 00:40:19.300
And storage is still expensive.

00:40:19.300 --> 00:40:22.250
We have Google [INAUDIBLE]
and these guys on the Cloud.

00:40:22.250 --> 00:40:26.390
So we were very aggressive
in cleaning up the data,

00:40:26.390 --> 00:40:29.090
rather than keeping
it for months.

00:40:29.090 --> 00:40:32.090
Because the intermediate results
are only kept for a week or so,

00:40:32.090 --> 00:40:34.790
and then the actual
results of the small subset

00:40:34.790 --> 00:40:38.383
is synced back to
our private cloud.

00:40:38.383 --> 00:40:40.490
Again, the other
thing is that the way

00:40:40.490 --> 00:40:43.470
it stands on the cloud for a
chip design or complex chip

00:40:43.470 --> 00:40:46.790
design like ours,
physical disks won't work.

00:40:46.790 --> 00:40:48.554
The SSD we learned the long way.

00:40:48.554 --> 00:40:49.970
We started with
the physical disk.

00:40:49.970 --> 00:40:51.210
It wasn't scaling.

00:40:51.210 --> 00:40:54.710
Then we had to go with all SSDs.

00:40:54.710 --> 00:40:59.270
And then like we talked
about, the NFS traffic

00:40:59.270 --> 00:41:01.912
is on a separate line, and
then the administrative traffic

00:41:01.912 --> 00:41:02.870
is on a different line.

00:41:02.870 --> 00:41:04.286
These are the key
lessons learned.

00:41:04.286 --> 00:41:07.380
And even today, we
are the only company

00:41:07.380 --> 00:41:12.384
that does the full physical
design on the Cloud.

00:41:12.384 --> 00:41:13.376
Yeah, that's it.

